## Mark Your Calendars

**October 9-11, 2026**

Rooted is Camp Otyokwah's fall retreat for High School students (grades 9-12). It is a time to step away from your busy, distracted life and take a breath. We invite students to come for a spiritual retreat — to renew their relationship with God in a personal and powerful way.

In just one weekend we will challenge campers with God's word, share the love of Jesus Christ, and worship together. All the while we will be having fun building relationships, playing games, and eating great food.

Whether you are a returning camper or joining us for the first time, Rooted is a great opportunity to grow in your faith and make lasting friendships!

## The Cost

The registration cost of Rooted is **$125** for early registration.

**$135** for registration after the early deadline on September 18th.

## Arrival & Pick-Up

**Check-in**: 7:00pm Friday at Hopewell Hall

**Pick-up**: 11:00am Sunday

## What to Expect

- Powerful Bible teaching and worship
- Breakout group discussions and prayer time
- Fall activities (campfires, hayrides, pumpkin contests)
- Great food and fellowship
- Dedicated time to focus on your relationship with God

## What to Bring

- Bible
- Sleeping bag and pillow
- Weather appropriate clothing for outdoors for the weekend
- Toiletries and personal care items
- Flashlight

## What NOT to Bring

- Electronics (phones, tablets, gaming devices)
- Expensive or irreplaceable items
- Weapons of any kind

